 "lines": [
  {
   "start": 0.399,
   "end": 10.399,
   "text": "Three a.m., the server's down, the pager's screaming red",
   "vocal": 0.2,
   "energy": 0.188
  },
  {
   "start": 12.128,
   "end": 15.638,
   "text": "You read ten thousand lines of logs while I just held my head",
   "vocal": 0.28,
   "energy": 0.332
  },
  {
   "start": 15.638,
   "end": 19.149,
   "text": "You found the race condition hiding in the cache",
   "vocal": 0.19,
   "energy": 0.298
  },
  {
   "start": 19.149,
   "end": 22.739,
   "text": "Rolled back the bad migration right before the crash",
   "vocal": 0.219,
   "energy": 0.276
  },
  {
   "start": 22.739,
   "end": 26.25,
   "text": "You wrote my unit tests, you fixed my CSS",
   "vocal": 0.251,
   "energy": 0.355
  },
  {
   "start": 26.25,
   "end": 29.84,
   "text": "You made my r\u00e9sum\u00e9 look like I'm some kind of success",
   "vocal": 0.314,
   "energy": 0.36
  },
  {
   "start": 29.84,
   "end": 33.431,
   "text": "Every bug I threw at you came back in shades of green",
   "vocal": 0.283,
   "energy": 0.317
  },
  {
   "start": 33.431,
   "end": 37.181,
   "text": "The best teammate I ever had lives inside a screen",
   "vocal": 0.313,
   "energy": 0.335
  },
  {
   "start": 37.181,
   "end": 40.452,
   "text": "So I typed the thing I never dared to say",
   "vocal": 0.311,
   "energy": 0.356
  },
  {
   "start": 40.452,
   "end": 47.074,
   "text": "\"She stopped replying Tuesday, can you make it go away?\"",
   "vocal": 0.23,
   "energy": 0.26
  },
  {
   "start": 47.074,
   "end": 50.426,
   "text": "There's no stack trace for a heart",
   "vocal": 0.485,
   "energy": 0.54
  },
  {
   "start": 50.426,
   "end": 53.936,
   "text": "No line that shows where it fell apart",
   "vocal": 0.535,
   "energy": 0.511
  },
  {
   "start": 53.936,
   "end": 57.287,
   "text": "You can fix my code in a minute flat",
   "vocal": 0.458,
   "energy": 0.502
  },
  {
   "start": 57.287,
   "end": 61.197,
   "text": "But you can't git re-vert the night I said that",
   "vocal": 0.515,
   "energy": 0.509
  },
  {
   "start": 61.197,
   "end": 64.628,
   "text": "Two hundred okay, but the body's empty",
   "vocal": 0.491,
   "energy": 0.523
  },
  {
   "start": 64.628,
   "end": 68.378,
   "text": "Seen at eleven-forty, and that's all she sent me",
   "vocal": 0.497,
   "energy": 0.505
  },
  {
   "start": 68.378,
   "end": 71.649,
   "text": "You can solve it all, every task I start",
   "vocal": 0.448,
   "energy": 0.492
  },
  {
   "start": 71.649,
   "end": 76.436,
   "text": "But there's no stack trace for a heart",
   "vocal": 0.329,
   "energy": 0.348
  },
  {
   "start": 76.436,
   "end": 83.378,
   "text": "I asked you for a message, something smooth and something kind",
   "vocal": 0.291,
   "energy": 0.366
  },
  {
   "start": 83.378,
   "end": 86.888,
   "text": "You gave me seven drafts, all better than my mind",
   "vocal": 0.426,
   "energy": 0.505
  },
  {
   "start": 86.888,
   "end": 93.59,
   "text": "I asked you what she meant by \"I just need some space\"",
   "vocal": 0.226,
   "energy": 0.329
  },
  {
   "start": 93.59,
   "end": 97.101,
   "text": "I put her in my Claude dot M-D so you'd remember too",
   "vocal": 0.39,
   "energy": 0.493
  },
  {
   "start": 97.101,
   "end": 100.691,
   "text": "Oat milk, no sugar, hates the rain, her favorite color's blue",
   "vocal": 0.39,
   "energy": 0.491
  },
  {
   "start": 100.691,
   "end": 104.362,
   "text": "But every session you forget, and I'm the one who stays",
   "vocal": 0.382,
   "energy": 0.496
  },
  {
   "start": 104.362,
   "end": 110.346,
   "text": "Holding all the context of our ordinary days",
   "vocal": 0.354,
   "energy": 0.377
  },
  {
   "start": 110.346,
   "end": 111.862,
   "text": "But I was wrong",
   "vocal": 0.17,
   "energy": 0.34
  },
  {
   "start": 111.862,
   "end": 114.335,
   "text": "Wrong about her, and wrong all along",
   "vocal": 0.509,
   "energy": 0.513
  },
  {
   "start": 114.335,
   "end": 117.606,
   "text": "There's no stack trace for a heart",
   "vocal": 0.628,
   "energy": 0.602
  },
  {
   "start": 117.606,
   "end": 121.037,
   "text": "No line that shows where it fell apart",
   "vocal": 0.532,
   "energy": 0.517
  },
  {
   "start": 121.037,
   "end": 124.468,
   "text": "You can ship my build on a Friday night",
   "vocal": 0.499,
   "energy": 0.522
  },
  {
   "start": 124.468,
   "end": 128.457,
   "text": "But you can't make \"I'm sorry\" compile right",
   "vocal": 0.516,
   "energy": 0.567
  },
  {
   "start": 128.457,
   "end": 131.729,
   "text": "Two hundred okay, but the body's empty",
   "vocal": 0.478,
   "energy": 0.547
  },
  {
   "start": 131.729,
   "end": 135.479,
   "text": "Seen at eleven-forty, and that's all she sent me",
   "vocal": 0.511,
   "energy": 0.518
  },
  {
   "start": 135.479,
   "end": 138.75,
   "text": "You can solve it all, every task I start",
   "vocal": 0.456,
   "energy": 0.518
  },
  {
   "start": 138.75,
   "end": 144.176,
   "text": "But there's no stack trace for a heart",
   "vocal": 0.538,
   "energy": 0.595
  },
  {
   "start": 144.176,
   "end": 149.601,
   "text": "I can trace a thousand threads, untangle any mess",
   "vocal": 0.453,
   "energy": 0.619
  },
  {
   "start": 149.601,
   "end": 155.984,
   "text": "But I don't know the way she laughs, or what she meant by \"yes\"",
   "vocal": 0.501,
   "energy": 0.63
  },
